{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:04:45.995089+00:00", "case_id": "C003", "input_text": "Tiene una herida profunda en el brazo con un sangrado que no cede aunque le hacemos presion directa; ya se ve muy palido, mareado y casi no puede hablar.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7523, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-LEVE", "score": 0.7181, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6954, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6867, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6764, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7523, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:04:47.560246+00:00", "case_id": "C004", "input_text": "El bebe de 2 anos tiene fiebre de 40 grados, esta muy decaido, casi no reacciona y le noto el cuello muy rigido.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.7718, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-LEVE", "score": 0.7375, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6842, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6664, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.6455, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7718, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:04:52.577694+00:00", "case_id": "C005", "input_text": "Se esta ahogando con un pedazo de comida, no puede hablar ni toser, y se esta poniendo morado.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.705, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6974, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6826, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.675, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6639, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "RES5596-N1", "confidence": 0.705, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:04:58.937600+00:00", "case_id": "C006", "input_text": "Tuvo un golpe fuerte en la cabeza jugando futbol, vomito varias veces seguidas y ahora tiene una pupila mas grande que la otra.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.7473, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.7258, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6513, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6449, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6274, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7473, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:04.401166+00:00", "case_id": "C007", "input_text": "Despues del choque el conductor esta muy palido, con el pulso muy rapido y debil, y no responde bien cuando le hablamos.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.7032, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6945, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6857, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6728, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6589, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "RES5596-N1", "confidence": 0.7032, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:08.477273+00:00", "case_id": "C008", "input_text": "Desde hace media hora tengo un dolor en el pecho que se corre hacia el brazo izquierdo, estoy sudando frio y antes he tenido problemas del corazon.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7646, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.7302, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6964, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.6475, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6459, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7646, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:14.584753+00:00", "case_id": "C009", "input_text": "Me falta el aire desde hace una hora, no puedo respirar bien, tengo los labios morados y siento que me ahogo.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.7353, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.7061, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6967, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.6779, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6707, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7353, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:20.457048+00:00", "case_id": "C010", "input_text": "Empezo a convulsionar hace unos minutos, todavia le dieron temblores fuertes en todo el cuerpo y no responde con claridad despues.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6892, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6726, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6659, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6517, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.6445, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.6659, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:25.829580+00:00", "case_id": "C011", "input_text": "Me siento muy mal y ya tengo un plan para quitarme la vida, incluso ya tengo listo lo que voy a usar.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-GRAVE", "score": 0.732, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-LEVE", "score": 0.7154, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6318, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.609, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.607, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.732, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:31.486222+00:00", "case_id": "C012", "input_text": "Tiene una cortada en la pierna que sangra mucho y no para de sangrar desde hace veinte minutos, aunque todavia responde y habla bien.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7264, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-LEVE", "score": 0.7134, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.679, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.674, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6731, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7264, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:36.494654+00:00", "case_id": "C013", "input_text": "Empezaron a hablarme raro y de pronto no reconocia a su familia, se le torcio la boca de un lado hace menos de una hora.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6765, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6645, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6528, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6299, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.6257, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.6645, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:05:38.630989+00:00", "case_id": "C014", "input_text": "Se desmayo de repente en la calle, cuando desperto estaba muy confundido y no sabia donde estaba.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6446, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6401, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6309, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6301, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6042, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.6309, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
